# CLIP ONNX model SHA-256 manifest
# Generated from models/ on the dev machine (2026-06-19).
# These files are NOT committed to the source repo (gitignored — too large).
# They are uploaded once to a dedicated GitHub Release on Jura-Labs/jura-trace
# (tag: model-assets-clip-v1) so CI can download + verify them.
#
# To verify locally:
#   sha256sum -c scripts/onnx-model-sha256.manifest
#   (run from the repo root; models must be present at models/)
#
# To update: re-export the ONNX models, recompute with sha256sum, update
# this file and commit. Bump the ONNX_ASSET_TAG in release.yml to a new
# release tag at the same time.
